  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "Security update for bind",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for bind fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-19630: amplified resource exhaustion in inbound message processing (bsc#1286575).\n- CVE-2026-94300: concurrent GSS-TSIG messages corrupt memory (bsc#1286578).\n- CVE-2026-96888: `named` may terminate unexpectedly when a redirect zone is used (bsc#1286579).\n- CVE-2026-97313: specific RPZ configurations and query patterns may result in an unexpected exit (bsc#1286580).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
